Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Online Class!

2
00:00:06.956 --> 00:00:08.541
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:11.029
Unit sixteen. Night Sky

4
00:00:12.907 --> 00:00:17.507
Let's learn eight new words. Listen, then it's your turn to say it!

5
00:00:18.507 --> 00:00:20.075
Owl!

6
00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:25.061
Owl. Your turn!

7
00:00:25.111 --> 00:00:26.224
Owl!

8
00:00:26.274 --> 00:00:27.424
Great!

9
00:00:28.407 --> 00:00:29.883
Bat!

10
00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:34.857
Bat. Your turn!

11
00:00:34.907 --> 00:00:36.062
Bat!

12
00:00:36.112 --> 00:00:37.262
Super!

13
00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:40.183
Lantern!

14
00:00:40.233 --> 00:00:45.413
Lantern. Your turn!

15
00:00:45.463 --> 00:00:46.687
Lantern!

16
00:00:46.737 --> 00:00:48.109
Well done!

17
00:00:49.273 --> 00:00:50.819
Torch!

18
00:00:50.869 --> 00:00:55.724
Torch. Your turn!

19
00:00:55.774 --> 00:00:56.801
Torch!

20
00:00:56.851 --> 00:00:58.001
Yes!

21
00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:00.493
Comet!

22
00:01:00.543 --> 00:01:05.246
Comet. Your turn!

23
00:01:05.296 --> 00:01:06.128
Comet!

24
00:01:06.178 --> 00:01:07.339
Good job!

25
00:01:08.632 --> 00:01:10.828
Shooting star!

26
00:01:10.878 --> 00:01:16.395
Shooting star. Your turn!

27
00:01:16.445 --> 00:01:18.112
Shooting star!

28
00:01:18.162 --> 00:01:19.428
Wonderful!

29
00:01:20.395 --> 00:01:22.394
Night bird!

30
00:01:22.444 --> 00:01:27.589
Night bird. Your turn!

31
00:01:27.639 --> 00:01:29.095
Night bird!

32
00:01:29.145 --> 00:01:30.295
