33
00:01:31.162 --> 00:01:32.684
Dark!

34
00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:37.473
Dark. Your turn!

35
00:01:37.523 --> 00:01:38.573
Dark!

36
00:01:38.623 --> 00:01:39.876
Excellent!

37
00:01:40.729 --> 00:01:48.179
Owl, Owl, Owl! Bat, Bat, Bat! Lantern, Lantern, Lantern! Torch, Torch, Torch!

38
00:01:48.229 --> 00:01:57.618
Comet, Comet, Comet! Shooting star, Shooting star! Night bird, Night bird! Dark, Dark, Dark!

39
00:01:57.668 --> 00:02:00.659
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:02:01.492 --> 00:02:11.435
It is dark outside. The owl says hoot, hoot, and a bat flies by. Look! A shooting star! Let's make a wish.

41
00:02:11.485 --> 00:02:14.129
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

42
00:02:14.812 --> 00:02:20.294
What is it? Can you say it?

43
00:02:20.344 --> 00:02:23.015
Shooting star! Well done!

44
00:02:23.946 --> 00:02:29.706
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:29.756 --> 00:02:32.202
Torch! Well done!

46
00:02:33.312 --> 00:02:38.992
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:39.042 --> 00:02:41.751
Night bird! Well done!

48
00:02:42.773 --> 00:02:44.659
Let's say it together!

49
00:02:44.709 --> 00:02:49.588
At night, I see an owl. At night, I see a comet.

50
00:02:49.638 --> 00:02:54.225
Your turn!

51
00:02:54.275 --> 00:02:59.112
At night, I see an owl. At night, I see a comet.

52
00:03:00.806 --> 00:03:05.634
What can you see in the dark?

53
00:03:05.684 --> 00:03:08.267
At night, I see an owl.

54
00:03:08.317 --> 00:03:09.655
Great answer!

55
00:03:10.761 --> 00:03:15.082
Today's value is wonder. Look up and wonder at the sky.

56
00:03:15.132 --> 00:03:17.326
I will try, Ms. Lily!

57
00:03:18.428 --> 00:03:25.103
Great job today, everyone! See you in Unit seventeen. Bye-bye!

58
00:03:25.153 --> 00:03:26.335
Bye-bye!

